      },
      "text": "And the most valuable thing you own is in none of the four boxes: the twenty people who learned,\nover a decade, which approaches do NOT work. It walks out at five o'clock and comes back voluntarily \u2014\nuntil one day it does not. Only a contract and a culture touch it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And the most valuable thing you own is in none of the four boxes: the twenty people who learned,\nover a decade, which approaches do NOT work. It walks out at five o'clock and comes back voluntarily \u2014\nuntil one day it does not. Only a contract and a culture touch it.",
